`c` stated in the ambient supremum norm -- which is the form produced by the
uniform Riccati flow -- becomes the Euclidean-radius width `c / d`. -/
theorem gaussianPhaseCoercivityVerificationBundle_explicitWidth
    {d : Nat} (H : Matrix (Fin d) (Fin d) Complex) {c : Real}
    (hd : 0 < d) (hc : 0 ≤ c)
    (hcoer : ∀ x : Fin d -> Complex,
      c * ‖x‖ ^ 2 ≤ (LiuWang2025SemilinearWaveRiccatiPhase.complexQuadratic H x).im)
    (z : Fin d -> Real) :
