theorem chartBeamVerificationBundle_traceCancellation {n : Nat} (i0 : Fin n)
    (u : LiuWang2025SemilinearWaveChartWKB.ChartJet n) {z : Fin n -> Real}
    (hz : z i0 = 0) :
    LiuWang2025SemilinearWaveChartBeamReflection.reflectedDifferenceJet i0 u z = 0 :=
  LiuWang2025SemilinearWaveChartBeamReflection.reflectedDifferenceJet_eq_zero_on_face
    i0 u hz

/-- **The reflected boundary rate, derived from the phase jets.**  Order-`N+1`
matching of the incident and reflected phases together with the transverse
coercivity of both forces the exponential difference into the `k = 1`, `j = 1`
slot of the source's displayed splitting, and the boundary Sobolev rate follows
