    (x : Fin n -> Real) :
    bcoer * LiuWang2025SemilinearWaveGaussianMassScaling.radiusSq x
      ≤ ((LiuWang2025SemilinearWaveChartQuadraticPhase.quadraticPhaseJet H c).val x).im :=
  LiuWang2025SemilinearWaveChartQuadraticPhase.quadraticPhaseJet_im_coercive H c hc hpos x

/-! ## Section 3: the finite-order construction

The chart beam of the previous section telescopes only when the eikonal
symbol, the leading transport expression and the hierarchy expressions vanish
*at the chart point*.  The source achieves less than that: it kills their
transverse Taylor jets at `z' = 0` through order `N`, so away from the central
ray each is a Taylor remainder.  The endpoints below close that gap.
